<title>BELGIUM: EU probes aid to Volvo Trucks.</title>
<headline>EU probes aid to Volvo Trucks.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it had decided to investigate regional transport aid to Volvo Trucks, a unit of Swedish vehicle maker Volvo.</p>
<p>The European Union executive said in a statement that Volvo's plant in the Swedish town of Umea had received about 31 million crowns of transport aid in 1995 and 1996 and estimated that roughly the same sum would be granted this year.</p>
<p>It said the money did not seem to comply with EU state aid rules. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
